This crate vendors three tags queries from Aider (https://github.com/Aider-AI/aider),
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0, for grammars that ship no
tags query of their own:

- src/vendor/scala-tags.scm, from aider/queries/tree-sitter-languages/scala-tags.scm
- src/vendor/kotlin-tags.scm, from aider/queries/tree-sitter-languages/kotlin-tags.scm
- src/vendor/bash-tags.scm, from aider/queries/tree-sitter-languages/bash-tags.scm

Each file's header names what was changed to compile against the grammar
pinned in Cargo.toml. A copy of the Apache License, Version 2.0 is at
https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0.
